From: UN1CA <unica@local>
Subject: [PATCH] Trial dm3q wide-pair Portrait digital zoom from1x to3x

Scope the seamless Portrait UI to dm3 devices with the feature enabled.
Pin rear Portrait routing to existing camera23 and retain DualBokehPhotoMaker.
Override only camera23 PORTRAIT bounds to1..3; keep the existing live/capture
CONTROL_ZOOM_RATIO and center-crop request path. Omit the second-tele shortcut
and clamp remembered rear Portrait zoom. Existing registers are unchanged.
Experimental: HAL crop acceptance, saved framing and depth/refocus alignment
above2x require flashed-device validation. This does not implement new native
crop commands, rewrite calibration or enable lens handoff. Existing disabled
Portrait patches remain disabled. Disable the feature flag to roll back.

